The licence itself says "Everyone is permitted to copy and distribute verbatim
copies of this license document, but changing it is not allowed", so it has to be
the exact file, not a retyped one. Two ways to get it right:

  curl -o LICENSE https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

or, when creating the repository on GitHub, use "Add a license" and choose
"GNU General Public License v3.0" - GitHub inserts the official text for you.

